{{wikipedia|Allahu Akbar}}
[[Image:FlagofWaziristan.png|thumb|{{Arab|[[الله أكبر]]}}]]
==English==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[Allah akbar]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar}} {{term|الله|sc=Arab|tr=’allāh}}, the [[desinential inflection]] ''-u'' (marking the nominative case), and {{term|أكبر|sc=Arab|tr=’ákbar||greater,” “greatest}}, the [[elative]] ({{compar}}/{{superl}}) of {{term|كبير|sc=Arab|tr=kabīr||big}}.

===Phrase===
'''[[Allah]]u [[akbar]]'''

# {{Islam}} The [[Muslim]] [[takbir]] ([[proclamation]]) "[[God]] is most [[great]]."

